menu "VG-100 Gateway"

    config VG_FACTORY_RESET_GPIO
        int "Factory reset GPIO"
        default 0
        range 0 48
        help
            Input for the factory reset control, active low with the internal
            pull-up enabled. The default is the BOOT button on an ESP32-S3
            development board.

            This is a build option rather than a constant because the VG-100
            pinout is not frozen. Freezing it is a hardware decision, and
            AI_GOVERNANCE.md puts hardware pinout changes after freeze behind
            Product Owner approval.

    config VG_FACTORY_RESET_HOLD_MS
        int "Factory reset hold time (ms)"
        default 5000
        range 1000 30000
        help
            How long the reset control must be held before stored Wi-Fi
            credentials are erased and the device reboots into provisioning.

            Long enough that it cannot happen by accident: the action is not
            recoverable, and the owner has to provision the gateway again
            from the app.

endmenu
